# Cursor Rules: Codebase Memory & Token Optimization

Always refer to the `memory-bank/` directory to understand project state and architecture:
- Read `memory-bank/activeContext.md` and `memory-bank/progress.md` before starting tasks.
- Avoid large whole-project code scans; perform targeted lookups only.
- Update `memory-bank/activeContext.md` and `memory-bank/progress.md` after completing meaningful work.
